; graph.extract.cfg (the Helm layer, _helm_tree): the named templates of a Go template. Node names from tree-sitter-gotmpl (checked on
; the real grammar by tests/test_graph_langcfg.py). @def the define / block action, @name its (first) string: the name of the template.
(define_action . (interpreted_string_literal) @name) @def
(block_action . (interpreted_string_literal) @name) @def
